.TH DANBY-BADFOOTBALL 1
.SH NAME
danby-badfootball \- unstable lateral flight of a poorly kicked football
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B temple/badfootball
.SH MODEL
Gravity and quadratic drag determine the basic arc.  A signed periodic lateral
force represents an unstable, poorly aligned rotation, producing a wobbling
plan-view path without corrupting the vertical trajectory.
.SH DISPLAY
Side and plan projections show the arc and lateral wobble separately.  Tracks
alter speed, elevation, aim, drag, wobble, and gravity.
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/danby/badfootball.b
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR flight3d (2)
